//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's property
// search, Jefferson Township and the Village of Mt. Sterling) were checked in a
// browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's property search is Pivot Point (auditor.co.madison.oh.us).
//   * Plain City's site is plaincityohio.gov (plain-city.com redirects).
//   * The Madison Messenger is at themadisonmessenger.com.
//   * OhioMeansJobs now points to the county center (omjmadisoncounty.org).
//   * The county site also answers at madison.oh.gov.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Madison County AL/IN/IL/NY/MS/TN/KY/VA/IA/NE and others ("TRAM" transit and
//   "Habitat of Madison County" are Indiana); London UK/KY/Ontario; Mount Sterling
//   KY; Plain City UT; West Jefferson NC; londonsownradio.org (an old WCYC-LP domain)
//   now shows spam.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (London, the seat). Villages with sites: Plain City (also in Union
//     County), West Jefferson and Mt. Sterling; Midway, Sedalia and South Solon have
//     none.
//   * Four school districts (London City, Madison-Plains, Jonathan Alder, Jefferson
//     Local), served by the Madison-Champaign ESC and Tolles Career & Technical
//     Center. No college campus is in the county.
//   * Madison Health (London); the Clark-Greene-Madison mental health board.
//     Prairie Oaks Metro Park straddles the Franklin line; Battelle Darby Creek's
//     pages show only Franklin County addresses and are left out.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * The London and Madison correctional institutions (state prisons) and the
//     Tri-County Regional Jail (Mechanicsburg).
//   * St. Patrick School London (page returns 404), the land bank, transit, dog
//     warden, most fire departments, a domestic violence shelter, YMCA and festivals:
//     no site found or not reached.

